WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.951
A cat jumped down from Tom's head.

2
00:00:04.952 --> 00:00:14.236
"Oops!" said Tom in surprise.

3
00:00:14.237 --> 00:00:17.051
"You're not a fur hat.

4
00:00:17.052 --> 00:00:20.637
You're a cat!"

5
00:00:20.638 --> 00:00:24.274
"Sorry about that," Tom said to the cat.

6
00:00:24.275 --> 00:00:29.278
"But I must go now.

7
00:00:29.279 --> 00:00:41.169
I need to find that map!"

8
00:00:41.170 --> 00:00:46.090
Tom went deeper and deeper into the forest.

9
00:00:46.091 --> 00:00:51.335
He looked behind branches and under roots.

10
00:00:51.336 --> 00:00:59.902
Everything looked dark and spooky.

11
00:00:59.903 --> 00:01:03.726
"Where is the map?" Tom thought.

12
00:01:03.727 --> 00:01:08.492
Snap! Snap! Crunch!

13
00:01:08.493 --> 00:01:11.749
Tom froze.

14
00:01:11.750 --> 00:01:14.092
Something was coming!

15
00:01:14.093 --> 00:01:17.153
He backed up slowly.

16
00:01:17.154 --> 00:01:20.745
Tom tripped and fell. "Oof!"

17
00:01:20.746 --> 00:01:26.617
Sticks snapped and leaves crunched.

18
00:01:26.618 --> 00:01:28.868
Tom closed his eyes.

19
00:01:28.869 --> 00:01:32.033
Suddenly—

20
00:01:32.034 --> 00:01:36.728
crash! A creature burst through the trees!

21
00:01:36.729 --> 00:01:39.159
It was the cat!

22
00:01:39.160 --> 00:01:42.107
Tom climbed to his feet.

23
00:01:42.108 --> 00:01:45.494
"Hello," said Cat.

24
00:01:45.495 --> 00:01:48.216
Tom's jaw dropped.

25
00:01:48.217 --> 00:01:51.524
"You can talk!" Tom said.

26
00:01:51.525 --> 00:01:55.453
"Cats have nine lives," Cat said.

27
00:01:55.454 --> 00:02:00.642
"In each life we can talk to one person."

28
00:02:00.643 --> 00:02:05.134
"And you picked me," Tom said.

29
00:02:05.135 --> 00:02:10.570
He bowed. "Thank you, Cat."

30
00:02:10.571 --> 00:02:14.969
Then Tom looked around the Dark Forest.

31
00:02:14.970 --> 00:02:20.153
He sighed. "I'm lost."

32
00:02:20.154 --> 00:02:23.649
"I can lead you out of the forest," said Cat.

33
00:02:23.650 --> 00:02:26.995
Tom grinned. "You can?"

34
00:02:26.996 --> 00:02:30.461
Cat nodded. "Sure."

35
00:02:30.462 --> 00:02:35.168
"Do you know where the palace is?" Tom asked.

36
00:02:35.169 --> 00:02:38.370
"I do," Cat said.

37
00:02:38.371 --> 00:02:45.766
She climbed into Tom's pocket.

38
00:02:45.767 --> 00:02:53.800
Together the new friends started walking.

